---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
import {PAGE_TITLE} from "../consts.ts";
import Layout from "../layouts/BlogPost.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<Layout
	title={PAGE_TITLE.about}
	description="About Me!"
>
	<p>
		Welcome to my website! I am Adam, a software developer based in England, primarily using web based
		technologies but with a versatile skill set having commercial experience in all aspects of development - Planning,
		implementation and deployment. Currently I am employed at <b>Pixelmill Digital</b>. On this website I am displaying
		a small showcase of projects I have worked on.
	</p>

	<p>
		Listed below are some of the technologies I am proficient or familiar with.
	</p>
		<ul>
			<li><b>Javascript/TypeScript/Node</b></li>
			<li><b>React, Express, Nestjs, Nextjs</b></li>
			<li><b>Python, PostgresSQL, MongoDB</b></li>
			<li><b>AWS (S3, EC2, ECS, CodePipeline/CodeBuild)</b></li>
			<li><b>Unity, PlayCanvas</b></li>
		</ul>

	<p>
		Want to contact me about working for you? You can contact my via Linkedin or email using the links below!
	</p>
</Layout>
